        "value": "<p><strong>Sample type &ndash; Peripheral blood in heparin</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Instrument &ndash;3 laser 10 color BD FACS LYRIC</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Panel used &ndash; Customised</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Clinical details &ndash; Known case of CLL, to look for CD20 expression</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Analysis</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gating Strategy: CD45 vs SSC</strong></p>\n<p>-83% viable singlets gated in the lymphocyte region.</p>\n<p>Out of these ~95% are CD19 positive B cells.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>CD20 &ndash; Positive (Partial Dim &ndash; Moderate)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Interpretation: The sample analysed shows CD19 positive B cells expressing partial CD20 expression</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Advice: Please correlate with clinical and treatment details.</strong></p>",
